  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with imagenet_vit_l image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion achieves high accuracy (0.7150). This experiment tests whether switching to resnet50 image encoder and weighted fusion (while keeping scvi_n200 and avgpool) improves performance, isolating the impact of image encoder and fusion method. It balances exploration of critical design choices without overcomplicating the setup."
